---
description: Studium UI tokens and adaptive layout (SwiftUI)
globs: Studium/**/*.swift
alwaysApply: false
---

- **Design tokens:** Typography, spacing, and shell dimensions live in `Studium/Views/Components/StudiumDesignSystem.swift` (SF Pro for chrome; monospaced only for `statDigitFont`, `questionIdFont`, and HTML bodies). Prefer tokens over magic numbers.
- **Wide vs compact:** When root width `>= LayoutMetrics.macWideBreakpoint` (900pt), Practice uses **split** `widePracticeSplitLayout`: filter column (`practiceSidebarWidth` 348pt, iPad 368pt) with `PracticeFilterPanel` in one raised card (`filterSidebarLayout`: 2-column chips, 16pt padding, 18pt section spacing) + pinned header/footer Start. Skill filter is a menu in the concept column. Below 900pt: Filters sheet + sticky Start on iPhone.
- **Concept cards:** `ExpandedConceptCard` in `Studium/Views/QuizTab/ExpandedConceptCard.swift` with `StudiumDesignSystem.concept*`.
- **Continue / saved quiz strip:** `ContinueSavedQuizCard` — fixed width `StudiumDesignSystem.continueCardWidth` on pad/Mac scroll; full width stack on iPhone.
- **Quiz:** Split-pane uses `StudiumDesignSystem.quiz*` insets. iOS/iPad split when `quizViewportWidth >= LayoutMetrics.macWideBreakpoint`; macOS always split. iPhone single-column uses `QuizBottomBar` inset instead of inline Prev/Next row.
- **Filters:** Full filter UI in `PracticeFilterSheet.swift`; do not revive deleted `FilterView.swift`.
